# Bytecode and the interpreter's caches — never part of the package.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The suite's artefacts. It writes these beside itself and reads them back as the evidence
# behind its tally; they are the record of one run, and not a thing under version control.
# Excluded by KIND and not by name: the last three were named out one at a time, and a fourth
# (suite-nowrap.log) walked straight past the list and into the first staging.
*.log
tests/suite.log
tests/run-journal.log
tests/watchdog-dump.log

# The marker a diagnosis plants to prove its own artefacts are fresh and not a corpse read as a
# result: an artefact of the same family, and it dirties `git status` on every use if it is left out.
.run-marker

# Forensics a crash handler drops in the CWD (as in ik-service).
crash_stack.txt

# Built output of the package proper.
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Windows redirect artifact (a stray '> nul' in a non-reserved context):
nul
